+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On the 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost was **11.9 ms
+p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that
+change, the measured cost was **1.05 ms p50**.
+
+The latter measurement includes the changes made at the same time: the
+trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK` constraint. Because
+these changes were measured together, the before/after result does not isolate
+the individual contribution of any one of them.
